# Ellines Tech — environment reference
#
# There is intentionally NO admin password variable for the frontend. The owner
# key lives only in the Cloudflare Pages environment as ADMIN_API_KEY; /admin/login
# posts the entered password to /api/cms, which verifies it at the edge and returns
# a short-lived God Mode session token. Nothing secret ships in the browser bundle.
#
# Local development: copy these into a gitignored `.dev.vars` file (Wrangler loads it).
# If ADMIN_API_KEY is unset locally, Wrangler uses a built-in local-only fallback.
# On Cloudflare Pages, ADMIN_API_KEY is required — there is no production fallback.
#
# Cloudflare Pages → Settings → Environment variables (server side):
#   ADMIN_API_KEY             Owner / God Mode key. Rotate after first deploy.
#   SUPER_ADMIN_EMAIL         Canonical Super Admin login (default: ellines.tech@gmail.com).
#   SUPER_ADMIN_BOOTSTRAP_PASSWORD
#                             Optional one-time seed. If the Super Admin account is
#                             missing, the next Super Admin sign-in creates it with
#                             this password (min 12 chars). Remove after first use.
#                             Prefer Owner-key bootstrap under Admin → Security & Password.
#
# Two-factor authentication (TOTP):
#   No env var required. Enable under Admin → Security & Password (owner-key session)
#   or Staff → Profile (account session). Secrets and recovery-code hashes live in KV
#   (cms:owner-totp / per-user fields). After enable, login asks for a 6-digit code.
#   PAYSTACK_SECRET_KEY       Live charges. Never commit.
#   PAYSTACK_WEBHOOK_SECRET   Optional; falls back to the secret key.
#   PAYSTACK_HUB_ORIGIN       Optional; defaults to the request origin.
#   RESEND_API_KEY            Transactional email (password reset, invoices).
#   RESEND_FROM               Optional "Name <address>" sender.
#   CAREERS_NOTIFY_EMAIL      Optional careers inbox.
#
# SMS for password-reset OTP (use one provider):
#   AT_USERNAME / AT_API_KEY  Africa's Talking (Kenya-first). Optional AT_SENDER.
#   TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID / TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN / TWILIO_FROM
#                             Twilio fallback when Africa's Talking is unset.
#
# Without RESEND_API_KEY (and SMS keys), reset codes are still generated + hashed in KV
# but are NOT delivered. The worker logs the code to the Functions console instead —
# that is for local/misconfigured deploys only; set provider keys for real delivery.
#
# Bindings (wrangler.toml / Pages dashboard):
#   ET_STORE                  KV namespace for all CMS + chat data.
#   AI                        Workers AI binding that powers Ellenia.
